gc.tierarten.maxlevel.body:
The limit applies to the [[gc.tiere.breedlevel|breeding level]] at birth and in eggs, to levelling up through [[gc.tiere.animalxp|animal experience]] and to the test command `gc_tierstufe`; young animals count as their species. Higher levels make an animal stronger, but only slowly, see [[gc.tierarten.species_cap]]. Current values:

- Wolf {gc_tierarten_species_max_wolf}, lox {gc_tierarten_species_max_lox}, boar {gc_tierarten_species_max_boar}, hen {gc_tierarten_species_max_hen}
- Asksvin {gc_tierarten_species_max_asksvin}, moose {gc_tierarten_species_max_moose}, bear {gc_tierarten_species_max_bjorn}, Vile {gc_tierarten_species_max_unbjorn}
- Neck {gc_tierarten_species_max_neck}, deer {gc_tierarten_species_max_deer}, hare {gc_tierarten_species_max_hare}, seal {gc_tierarten_species_max_seal}, other animals {gc_tierarten_species_max_other}
